    {
      "name": "setup",
      "title": "PAPER ROUND TRIP: READ FIRST",
      "type": "note",
      "text": "PAPER ONLY. Buys exactly 1 NVDA share, verifies it, then sells that share and verifies zero holdings. Edge maximized on the primary display: browser client including chrome 1920x1140 physical pixels, Windows scale 125%, browser zoom 67%, http://127.0.0.1:8765/ at the very top. ScreenAutomation belongs on the left monitor, not covering the page. Coordinates are display-specific UI points. Start with NVIDIA selected, Market order, zero shares and no orders. Verify the layout before arming one_order. Do not touch the browser during the run. Stop and inspect order history before any retry: a failed confirmation does not undo a filled order. Saved disarmed; loading resets the once latch. This is a fixed one-share test, not a trading strategy.",
      "position": [
        -17.801311,
        -279.39072
      ],
      "region": null,
      "color": [
        245,
        230,
        150
      ],
      "opacity": 0.3
    },
